ing, PVP, Factions, House Building","path":"/game/4540286603-northwind","slug":"4540286603-northwind","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/84d7cc6e924d0ccacdc5090f75154da74078841856af22e9cea0e8ff568ecb1c.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-41d2ccc4b7980956f859d7df41b89d32/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":219,"visitor":28497980,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T21:43:17.853Z","creator":{"name":"NORTHWIND | HUB","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":123414640536127,"name":"Power Lifters 💪","desc":"Welcome to Powerlifters💥\nThe most realistic weight lifting game!\n\nLift weights and become the strongest person in the world!🏆","path":"/game/123414640536127-power-lifters","slug":"123414640536127-power-lifters","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/0b95fa548ee350617716eb0502df031d52a5fb63ec0f48c7260c0d18b66e4821.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-df716399055cbb7085e259069078ffb3/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":219,"visitor":3974423,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-08-22T16:42:07.436Z","creator":{"name":"Gym Freaks","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}}],"totalGames":14094,"totalPages":588,"currentPage":100}